Package: localanomaly
Title: Local Time Series Anomaly Detection
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R:
    person("Claudia", "Mark", email = "markclau1@myvuw.ac.nz", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Detects and classifies unusual observations in time series data using local neighbourhood statistics and temporal patterns. Provides tools for data cleaning, anomaly scoring, classification, visualisation, and summarisation.
